{"_id":"68d97b66a3ca8cef97fccdb1","title":"ANTI AFK","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d00fb441d3f11fd43f709db9e724a2354ad99873789620e9de396f5994d8b19f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1759083366628.png"},"slug":"universal","path":"/game/universal","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/d00fb441d3f11fd43f709db9e724a2354ad99873789620e9de396f5994d8b19f.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1759083366628.png"},"placeId":0},"slug":"Universal-Script-ANTI-AFK-55528","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":21804,"executes":1943,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/50fb8b86496cde8b251a24858b185f25360ddfb8c195c2d50526a40a88afce95.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1759083366628.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1759083366628.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/50fb8b86496cde8b251a24858b185f25360ddfb8c195c2d50526a40a88afce95.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1759083366628.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1759083366628.png"},"likeCount":7,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2025-09-28T18:16:06.642Z","updatedAt":"2025-09-28T18:16:06.642Z","lastBump":"2025-09-28T18:16:06.642Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ZEXT512/AntiAfkXs/refs/heads/main/Anti\"))()","features":"🟢 Core Features\n\n1.Anti-AFK System\n\n  🟢 Prevents Roblox’s AFK detection by simulating user input.\n\n  🟢 Two mechanisms:  On idle (triggers when Roblox detects inactivity).\n\n  🟢 Periodic tick (every 240s by default).\n\n2.Lag Watchdog\n\n  🟢  Monitors delay between frames (dt).\n\n  🟢  If delay exceeds threshold (default 0.6s), increments a lag counter.\n\n  🟢  When lag counter exceeds limit:\n\n  🟢  Action = None → does nothing.\n\n  🟢  Action = Respawn → reloads your character.\n\n  🟢  Action = Rejoin → rejoins the game or server-hops.\n\n3.Auto Rejoin on Disconnect\n\n   🟢  Detects Roblox error popup (e.g., Error 277: Lost connection).\n\n    🟢 Attempts to reconnect:\n\n        🟢  First, tries same server instance.\n\n        🟢  If fails, rejoins the place.\n\n4.Server Hop Support\n\n   🟢  Finds a new server with space.\n\n    🟢   Useful to escape laggy/empty servers.\n\n🔸 Manual Controls\n\n1.Manual Respawn\n\n    🟢  Instantly respawns your character.\n\n    🟢  Shows timestamp in three formats: Local, UTC, Bangkok (for reference).\n\n2.Manual Rejoin (Server Hop)\n\n  🟢 Rejoins the game manually.\n\n  🟢 If ServerHop = true, attempts to find a new server.\n\n🔹 UI & Display\n\n1.RightShift Toggle\n\n      🟢  Press RightShift to open/close the menu.\n\n2.Expandable/Collapsible Log \n\n     🟢   Expandable/Collapsible Log\n\n3.System Stats Display\n🟢Real-time:\n\n     🟢  FPS (frames per second).\n\n     🟢  CPU usage (approximate).\n\n     🟢  RAM usage (MB).\n\n     🟢  Ping (ms).\n\n     🟢  Session time (minutes in current server).","tags":[],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"62837a3cdda8b2d71a12a9be","username":"Akarameck2009","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"status":"offline","id":"62837a3cdda8b2d71a12a9be","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-20T02:58:14.823Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"68d97b66a3ca8cef97fccdb3","editBy":{"_id":"62837a3cdda8b2d71a12a9be","username":"Akarameck2009","status":"offline","id":"62837a3cdda8b2d71a12a9be"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-09-28T18:16: